  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Central Asia Regional Economic Cooperation Corridors 1, 2, and 6 Connector Road (Kyzylorda-Zhezkazgan) Reconstruction Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will reconstruct a strategic 208-kilometer (km) section of the Kyzylorda and Zhezkazgan corridor in the Ulytau region, upgrading it to a higher two-lane standard, climate-resilient road, which will improve regional connectivity and boost trade and socioeconomic opportunities in central Kazakhstan. The project will also strengthen KAZH&amp;apos;s institutional capacity in climate resilience, gender equality, and financial sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
